As the main platform of all-media news information products created by Xinhua News Agency, Xinhuanet releases global news information 24 hours daily.

Download Xinhuanet App now and you can:
- Stay informed with authoritative information and in-depth analysis from our global network;
- Access to everything you need to know about the latest on China, World, Economy and many more;
- Never miss breaking news by subscribing to push notifications;
- Watch video and livestreaming;
- View photo galleries and full-screen images;
- Customize your newsfeed;
- Share stories to your social networks, or email/SMS to a friend.

The Xinhuanet App will keep your information secure and not share it with anyone else in accordance with the Xinhuanet App’s Privacy Policy.
